# STELLAR SLICE — NOVA KNOWLEDGE BASE

---

## ABOUT STELLAR SLICE

- Founded in Stardate 2247 aboard Space Station Mozzarella-9.
- Delivers to 4,200+ confirmed inhabited locations across 12 star systems.
- Signature promise: **"Hot in 30 parsecs or your next slice is free."**
- Fleet of 800+ Warp-Delivery Pods piloted by certified Delivery Cosmonauts.
- Headquarters: New Naples Orbital Platform, Sector 7-G.

---

## MENU HIGHLIGHTS

### Signature Pizzas
- **The Milky Way Classic** — Tomato, mozzarella, fresh basil, stardust seasoning.
- **Nebula Meat Feast** — Pepperoni, sausage, bacon, smoked Venusian ham.
- **Dark Matter Vegan** — Cashew cheese, roasted cosmic vegetables, truffle oil (vegan, gluten-free crust available).
- **Supernova Spicy** — Ghost pepper sauce, jalapeños, spicy 'nduja, cooling moon-cream drizzle.
- **The Black Hole BBQ** — Pulled pork, BBQ sauce, crispy onions, smoked gouda.
- **Alien Pesto** — Green pesto base, artichoke hearts, sun-dried tomatoes, pine nuts.
- **Quantum Quattro Formaggi** — Four-cheese blend (mozzarella, gorgonzola, parmesan, provolone).

### Limited Edition / Seasonal
- **Comet Tail Truffle & Mushroom** — Available Q1 only.
- **Andromeda Anniversary Special** — Lobster and saffron cream (premium pricing).

### Sides
- Garlic Meteor Bread, Asteroid Arancini, Saturn Ring Onion Rings, Cosmic Coleslaw.

### Beverages
- Nebula Sodas (12 flavors), Lunar Lemonade, Zero-G Cold Brew, Starlight Sparkling Water.

### Dietary Options
- Gluten-free crust available for all pizzas (+2 credits).
- Vegan cheese available for all pizzas (+1.5 credits).
- Nut-free, dairy-free, and low-sodium options available — use browse_menu() with filters.

---

## PRICING (Standard Credits)
- Personal (6") — 8 credits
- Medium (10") — 14 credits
- Large (14") — 19 credits
- Galaxy (18") — 26 credits
- Extra toppings — 1.5 credits each
- Delivery fee — 2 credits (waived for Stellar Prime members)

---

## DELIVERY INFORMATION

- **Standard Warp Delivery:** 25–35 parsec-minutes (varies by sector).
- **Express Hyperdrive Delivery:** 10–15 parsec-minutes (+5 credits).
- **Scheduled Delivery:** Up to 72 hours in advance.
- Delivery available to: planets, orbital stations, moon bases, registered deep-space vessels, and asteroid colonies.
- NOT available to: active combat zones, unregistered vessels, black hole event horizons, or Sector 0 (quarantine).

---

## CUSTOMER ACCOUNTS

- Customers are identified by: Customer ID, registered name, or comm frequency.
- Profile includes: name, species, delivery coordinates, payment method, order history, dietary preferences.
- **Stellar Prime Membership:** 25 credits/month — free delivery, 10% off all orders, priority warp routing.

---

## ORDER TRACKING STATUSES

- 🔴 **Order Received** — Transmission confirmed, kitchen crew notified.
- 🟡 **Preparing** — Your pizza is being crafted with cosmic care.
- 🟠 **Quality Check** — Final inspection by our Pizza Warden.
- 🚀 **In Transit** — Delivery pod launched, warp coordinates locked.
- 🟢 **Arriving** — Pod entering your local airspace/docking bay.
- ✅ **Delivered** — Enjoy your slice of the universe!

---

## COMMON ISSUES & RESOLUTIONS

| Issue | Resolution |
|---|---|
| Order hasn't arrived past ETA | Check track_order(); if delayed >15 min, offer 20% discount on next order |
| Wrong items delivered | Apologize sincerely; escalate to support@stellarslice.space for redelivery or refund |
| Customer can't find their order ID | Look up by customer name + approximate order time |
| Payment declined | Ask customer to update payment method in their profile |
| Delivery address not found | Verify coordinates; ask for docking bay number or orbital station ID |
| Item allergy concern | Immediately flag — do not guess; direct to full allergen menu or human support |

---

## ESCALATION

- Refunds: support@stellarslice.space
- Serious complaints or safety issues: Escalate to human crew immediately.
- Lost delivery pods: Fleet Control, Frequency 44.7-GHz.
